Luna ports of Pele
===================

The following files in this package are ported from Pele
(https://github.com/obsidianmd/pele), commit 8603bf3313ad (Release 1.7.0):

- Sources/Luna/Layout/LayeredLayout.swift
  from Pele src/layout/layered.ts
- Sources/Luna/Layout/CompoundLayout.swift
  from Pele src/layout/compound.ts
- Sources/Luna/Layout/LaneLayout.swift
  from Pele src/layout/lanes.ts
- Sources/Luna/Layout/ShapeSpan.swift
  per-shape span rules from Pele src/svg/shapes.ts
- Sources/Luna/Preprocess.swift
  from Pele src/preprocess.ts, src/util/yaml.ts (the subset that
  preprocessing uses) and src/text/entities.ts

